iki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(status_group)\" title=\"Poisoned (status group)\">Poisoned</a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">DEN_APPRENTICE_THORN_1</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DEN_APPRENTICE_THORN_1+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DEN_APPRENTICE_THORN_1+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">DEN_APPRENTICE_THORN</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CDEN_APPRENTICE_THORN%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CDEN_APPRENTICE_THORN%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Poisoned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Poisoned\">SG_Poisoned</a>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This condition is inflicted during <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Get_Help_from_Healer_Nettie\" title=\"Get Help from Healer Nettie\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Get Help from Healer Nettie\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Get_Help_from_Healer_Nettie\" title=\"Get Help from Healer Nettie\">Get Help from Healer Nettie</a> by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nettie\" title=\"Nettie\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/25px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/38px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/50px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nettie\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/25px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nettie\" title=\"Nettie\">Nettie</a> when she attack you with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kelemvor%27s_Kiss_Branch\" title=\"Kelemvor's Kiss Branch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kelemvor%27s_Kiss_Branch\" title=\"Kelemvor's Kiss Branch\">Kelemvor's Kiss Branch</a>.</li>\n<li>While themed to be cured by the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Silvanus\" title=\"Elixir of Silvanus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/ELX_Elixir_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/ELX_Elixir_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/ELX_Elixir_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/ELX_Elixir_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/ELX_Elixir_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Silvanus\" title=\"Elixir of Silvanus\">Elixir of Silvanus</a> which Nettie carries, all <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Poisoned#Removal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Poisoned\">methods</a> that target the poisoned status group are effective.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>DEN_APPRENTICE_THORN</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"At_Death's_Door\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/At_Death%27s_Door_(Advanced)_(Condition)\" title=\"At Death's Door (Advanced) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/At_Death%27s_Door_Advanced_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-At_Death%27s_Door_Advanced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/At_Death%27s_Door_Advanced_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-At_Death%27s_Door_Advanced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/At_Death%27s_Door_Advanced_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-At_Death%27s_Door_Advanced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"At Death's Door\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/At_Death%27s_Door_Advanced_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-At_Death%27s_Door_Advanced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/At_Death%27s_Door_Advanced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/At_Death%27s_Door_(Advanced)_(Condition)\" title=\"At Death's Door (Advanced) (Condition)\">At Death's Door</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Advanced Toxic Infection. <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> are reduced by 6. The more the creature rests, the worse it feels.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"At_Death's_Door\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/At_Death%27s_Door_(Moderate)_(Condition)\" title=\"At Death's Door (Moderate) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/At_Death%27s_Door_Moderate_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-At_Death%27s_Door_Moderate_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/At_Death%27s_Door_Moderate_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-At_Death%27s_Door_Moderate_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/At_Death%27s_Door_Moderate_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-At_Death%27s_Door_Moderate_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"At De